@startuml
!theme plain
|a_default| Default
|a_default|
start
:Receive the contract for the marketing campaign;
:Take the contract to the department;
:Input customer details into NKE;
:v1: Are the customer details missing? ({Missing, Ready}); <<objectSignal>>
if () then ([v1 = "Missing"])
:Contact the customers;
:Receive additional customer details;
:Create a suitable team;
else ([v1 = "Ready"])
:Create a suitable team;
endif
:Check previous campaigns for reusable material;
:Are reusable ideas found from previous campaigns?;
repeat :Create a new concept;
:Integrate new ideas and add further points;
:Integrate the revised campaign into the database;
:Present the concept to the relevant party for consideration;
:v3: Is the concept accepted? ({Accepted, Declined}); <<objectSignal>>
backward:Rework the concept;
repeat while () is ([v3 = "Declined"]) not ([v3 = "Accepted"])
:Present the concept to the customer;
stop
@enduml